{"seq":4,"slug":"compositing","title":"合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/dom-and-cssom/compositing","wordCount":965,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"合成\">合成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>合成是渲染流水线的最后阶段：浏览器把页面拆成多个<strong>图层（Layers）</strong>，经<strong>图块化（Tiling）</strong> 后在光栅化线程池转为位图，最终由 GPU 合成输出到屏幕。它运行在独立的<strong>合成线程</strong>上，因此即使主线程忙于 JavaScript，滚动和 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 动画依然流畅——这也是这些属性性能最优的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是合成\">什么是合成</h2><p><strong>合成（Compositing）</strong> 是渲染流水线的最后一步。浏览器将页面分成多个<strong>图层（Layers）</strong>，分别光栅化后由 GPU 合成到一起，最终输出到屏幕。合成发生在<strong>合成线程</strong>上，不阻塞主线程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    MainThread[&quot;主线程&quot;]&#10;    MainThread --&gt;|提交图层树| CompositorThread[&quot;合成线程&quot;]&#10;    CompositorThread --&gt;|分割图块| Tiles[&quot;图块 Tiles&quot;]&#10;    Tiles --&gt;|光栅化| RasterThreads[&quot;光栅化线程池&quot;]&#10;    RasterThreads --&gt;|位图| GPUMemory[&quot;GPU 纹理&quot;]&#10;    GPUMemory --&gt;|合成| DrawQuads[&quot;绘制四边形&quot;]&#10;    DrawQuads --&gt;|提交| Screen[&quot;屏幕&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    MainThread[\"主线程\"]\n    MainThread --&gt;|提交图层树| CompositorThread[\"合成线程\"]\n    CompositorThread --&gt;|分割图块| Tiles[\"图块 Tiles\"]\n    Tiles --&gt;|光栅化| RasterThreads[\"光栅化线程池\"]\n    RasterThreads --&gt;|位图| GPUMemory[\"GPU 纹理\"]\n    GPUMemory --&gt;|合成| DrawQuads[\"绘制四边形\"]\n    DrawQuads --&gt;|提交| Screen[\"屏幕\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"合成线程的工作流程\">合成线程的工作流程</h2><p>合成线程是独立于主线程的线程，即使主线程忙于执行 JavaScript，合成线程依然可以处理滚动和合成动画。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant MT as 主线程&#10;    participant CT as 合成线程&#10;    participant RT as 光栅化线程&#10;    participant GPU as GPU&#10;&#10;    MT-&gt;&gt;CT: 提交图层树 (Commit)&#10;    CT-&gt;&gt;CT: 计算可见区域&#10;    CT-&gt;&gt;CT: 划分图块 (Tiling)&#10;    CT-&gt;&gt;RT: 提交图块光栅化任务&#10;    RT-&gt;&gt;GPU: 上传纹理&#10;    RT--&gt;&gt;CT: 光栅化完成&#10;    CT-&gt;&gt;GPU: 发送 Draw Quads&#10;    GPU-&gt;&gt;GPU: 合成所有图层&#10;    GPU--&gt;&gt;CT: 帧显示完成\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant MT as 主线程\n    participant CT as 合成线程\n    participant RT as 光栅化线程\n    participant GPU as GPU\n\n    MT-&gt;&gt;CT: 提交图层树 (Commit)\n    CT-&gt;&gt;CT: 计算可见区域\n    CT-&gt;&gt;CT: 划分图块 (Tiling)\n    CT-&gt;&gt;RT: 提交图块光栅化任务\n    RT-&gt;&gt;GPU: 上传纹理\n    RT--&gt;&gt;CT: 光栅化完成\n    CT-&gt;&gt;GPU: 发送 Draw Quads\n    GPU-&gt;&gt;GPU: 合成所有图层\n    GPU--&gt;&gt;CT: 帧显示完成</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>线程</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交（Commit）</td>\n<td>主线程 → 合成线程</td>\n<td>将图层树的副本发送到合成线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图块化（Tiling）</td>\n<td>合成线程</td>\n<td>将大图层分割为 256×256 或 512×512 的图块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光栅化（Raster）</td>\n<td>光栅化线程</td>\n<td>将图块的绘制指令转换为位图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纹理上传</td>\n<td>光栅化线程 → GPU</td>\n<td>将位图上传为 GPU 纹理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绘制（Draw）</td>\n<td>合成线程</td>\n<td>生成 Draw Quads 发送到 GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显示（Display）</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>合成所有图层输出到屏幕</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"图块化-tiling\">图块化（Tiling）</h2><p>浏览器不会一次性光栅化整个图层，而是将其分割为<strong>图块（Tiles）</strong>，优先光栅化可视区域附近的图块。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Tile {&#10;  layerId: number;&#10;  x: number;&#10;  y: number;&#10;  width: number;&#10;  height: number;&#10;  priority: &#39;highest&#39; | &#39;high&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;low&#39;;&#10;  rasterized: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateTilePriority(&#10;  tile: { x: number; y: number },&#10;  viewport: { scrollX: number; scrollY: number; width: number; height: number },&#10;): Tile[&#39;priority&#39;] {&#10;  const tileCenter = { x: tile.x + 128, y: tile.y + 128 };&#10;  const viewportCenter = {&#10;    x: viewport.scrollX + viewport.width / 2,&#10;    y: viewport.scrollY + viewport.height / 2,&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  const distance = Math.hypot(tileCenter.x - viewportCenter.x, tileCenter.y - viewportCenter.y);&#10;&#10;  if (distance &lt; viewport.height) return &#39;highest&#39;;&#10;  if (distance &lt; viewport.height * 2) return &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  if (distance &lt; viewport.height * 4) return &#39;medium&#39;;&#10;  return &#39;low&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  layerId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'highest'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rasterized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateTilePriority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  viewport</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scrollX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">scrollY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">width</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Tile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'priority'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> tileCenter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { x: tile.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: tile.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> viewportCenter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x: viewport.scrollX </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewport.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    y: viewport.scrollY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewport.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hypot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tileCenter.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewportCenter.x, tileCenter.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewportCenter.y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewport.height) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'highest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewport.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewport.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Layer[&quot;图层 (2000x5000px)&quot;]&#10;    Layer --&gt; Grid[&quot;分割为图块网格&quot;]&#10;    Grid --&gt; VP[&quot;可视区域图块\\n优先光栅化&quot;]&#10;    Grid --&gt; Near[&quot;附近图块\\n次优先&quot;]&#10;    Grid --&gt; Far[&quot;远处图块\\n低优先级&quot;]&#10;    VP --&gt; Raster[&quot;立即光栅化&quot;]&#10;    Near --&gt; Queue[&quot;加入队列&quot;]&#10;    Far --&gt; Defer[&quot;延迟处理&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Layer[\"图层 (2000x5000px)\"]\n    Layer --&gt; Grid[\"分割为图块网格\"]\n    Grid --&gt; VP[\"可视区域图块\\n优先光栅化\"]\n    Grid --&gt; Near[\"附近图块\\n次优先\"]\n    Grid --&gt; Far[\"远处图块\\n低优先级\"]\n    VP --&gt; Raster[\"立即光栅化\"]\n    Near --&gt; Queue[\"加入队列\"]\n    Far --&gt; Defer[\"延迟处理\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-纹理上传\">GPU 纹理上传</h2><p>光栅化完成后，位图数据需要上传到 GPU 显存作为<strong>纹理（Texture）</strong>。这个过程可能成为性能瓶颈。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>上传方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>软件光栅化 + 上传</td>\n<td>CPU 光栅化后上传纹理</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 光栅化（OOP-R）</td>\n<td>直接在 GPU 上光栅化</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零拷贝纹理</td>\n<td>使用共享内存避免拷贝</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function checkGPUAcceleration(): void {&#10;  const canvas = document.createElement(&#39;canvas&#39;);&#10;  const gl = canvas.getContext(&#39;webgl&#39;);&#10;&#10;  if (gl) {&#10;    const debugInfo = gl.getExtension(&#39;WEBGL_debug_renderer_info&#39;);&#10;    if (debugInfo) {&#10;      const renderer = gl.getParameter(debugInfo.UNMASKED_RENDERER_WEBGL);&#10;      console.log(&#39;GPU Renderer:&#39;, renderer);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const maxTextureSize = gl.getParameter(gl.MAX_TEXTURE_SIZE);&#10;    console.log(&#39;Max texture size:&#39;, maxTextureSize);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;checkGPUAcceleration();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkGPUAcceleration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> canvas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'canvas'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> gl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webgl'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"