;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> animatedElement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.animated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animatedElement.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mouseenter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  animatedElement.style.willChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transform, opacity'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animatedElement.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'transitionend'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  animatedElement.style.willChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">animatedElement.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mouseleave'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  animatedElement.style.willChange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'auto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>will-change</code> 的最佳实践：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>动画前设置，动画后移除</td>\n<td>避免长期占用 GPU 内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只用于实际会变化的属性</td>\n<td><code>transform</code>, <code>opacity</code> 最常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>避免在大量元素上使用</td>\n<td>每个层都消耗 GPU 内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不要用 <code>will-change: all</code></td>\n<td>无效且可能适得其反</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Chrome DevTools 的 Layers 面板中可以看到每个合成层的内存占用。一个 1000×1000 的图层大约占用 4MB GPU 内存（RGBA，每像素 4 字节）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"transform-和-opacity-的优势\">transform 和 opacity 的优势</h2><p><code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 是仅有的两个可以完全在合成线程上处理的属性，不触发布局和绘制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Slow[&quot;触发完整流水线&quot;]&#10;        S1[&quot;JS/CSS 变更&quot;] --&gt; S2[&quot;Style&quot;]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[&quot;Layout&quot;]&#10;        S3 --&gt; S4[&quot;Paint&quot;]&#10;        S4 --&gt; S5[&quot;Composite&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Fast[&quot;仅合成&quot;]&#10;        F1[&quot;transform/opacity 变更&quot;] --&gt; F2[&quot;Composite&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Slow[\"触发完整流水线\"]\n        S1[\"JS/CSS 变更\"] --&gt; S2[\"Style\"]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[\"Layout\"]\n        S3 --&gt; S4[\"Paint\"]\n        S4 --&gt; S5[\"Composite\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Fast[\"仅合成\"]\n        F1[\"transform/opacity 变更\"] --&gt; F2[\"Composite\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function slideIn(element: HTMLElement): Animation {&#10;  return element.animate(&#10;    [&#10;      { transform: &#39;translateX(-100%)&#39;, opacity: 0 },&#10;      { transform: &#39;translateX(0)&#39;, opacity: 1 },&#10;    ],&#10;    {&#10;      duration: 300,&#10;      easing: &#39;cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)&#39;,&#10;      fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function fadeOut(element: HTMLElement): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  return new Promise((resolve) =&gt; {&#10;    const animation = element.animate([{ opacity: 1 }, { opacity: 0 }], {&#10;      duration: 200,&#10;      fill: &#39;forwards&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    animation.onfinish = () =&gt; resolve();&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> slideIn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(-100%)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { transform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'translateX(0)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      easing: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      fill: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forwards'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fadeOut</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> animation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">animate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([{ opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { opacity: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      duration: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      fill: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'forwards'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    animation.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onfinish</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>Layout</th>\n<th>Paint</th>\n<th>Composite</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>width</code> / <code>height</code></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>color</code> / <code>background</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transform</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>opacity</code></td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"滚动合成\">滚动合成</h2><p>当用户滚动页面时，合成线程可以独立处理滚动而不需要主线程参与。这就是为什么即使主线程繁忙，页面滚动仍然可以保持流畅。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const scrollContainer = document.querySelector&lt;HTMLElement&gt;(&#39;.scroll-container&#39;)!;&#10;&#10;scrollContainer.addEventListener(&#10;  &#39;scroll&#39;,&#10;  () =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;Scroll position:&#39;, scrollContainer.scrollTop);&#10;  },&#10;  { passive: true },&#10;);&#10;&#10;scrollContainer.addEventListener(&#10;  &#39;touchstart&#39;,&#10;  (e: TouchEvent) =&gt; {&#10;    console.log(&#39;Touch start&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;  { passive: true },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scrollContainer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">querySelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.scroll-container'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scrollContainer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'scroll'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Scroll position:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, scrollContainer.scrollTop);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { passive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scrollContainer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'touchstart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TouchEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Touch start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { passive: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>滚动类型</th>\n<th>处理线程</th>\n<th>条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快速滚动</td>\n<td>合成线程</td>\n<td>无非 passive 的 touch/wheel 监听器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带监听器的滚动</td>\n<td>合成线程 + 主线程</td>\n<td>passive: true 时仍在合成线程滚动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS 驱动的滚动</td>\n<td>主线程</td>\n<td><code>scrollTop</code> 赋值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 始终为 <code>touchstart</code>、<code>touchmove</code> 和 <code>wheel</code> 事件添加 <code>{ passive: true }</code> 选项，确保合成线程可以立即开始滚动而不必等待主线程确认事件是否被 <code>preventDefault()</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>合成</strong>是渲染流水线的最后阶段，将多个图层在 GPU 上合成为最终画面</li>\n<li>合成线程独立于主线程，即使 JS 繁忙也能处理滚动和 <code>transform</code>/<code>opacity</code> 动画</li>\n<li>图层被<strong>分块（Tiling）</strong> 处理，可视区域优先光栅化</li>\n<li><code>will-change</code> 可提升元素为独立合成层，但需要在动画结束后及时移除</li>\n<li><code>transform</code> 和 <code>opacity</code> 跳过布局和绘制，是性能最优的动画属性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"合成","id":"合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是合成","id":"什么是合成"},{"level":2,"text":"合成线程的工作流程","id":"合成线程的工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"图块化（Tiling）","id":"图块化-tiling"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 纹理上传","id":"gpu-纹理上传"},{"level":2,"text":"will-change 与图层提升","id":"will-change-与图层提升"},{"level":2,"text":"transform 和 opacity 的优势","id":"transform-和-opacity-的优势"},{"level":2,"text":"滚动合成","id":"滚动合成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"布局与绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/dom-and-cssom/layout-and-paint"},"next":{"title":"HTTP 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/networking/http-lifecycle"}}